### ============================================================
### ADMIN API ENDPOINTS TEST - v4.0
### Hệ thống Thuê & Bán Đồ Ngắn Hạn - UTE Đà Nẵng
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = https://localhost:7000
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### ============================================================
### 1. LOGIN AS ADMIN
### ============================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ute.udn.vn",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### ============================================================
### 2. DASHBOARD - Thống kê tổng quan
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============================================================
### 3. STATISTICS - Thống kê chi tiết
### ============================================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/statistics
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============================================================
### 4. USERS - Danh sách người dùng
### ============================================================

### Lấy tất cả users (page 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/users?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Tìm kiếm user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/users?search=Nguyễn&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lấy chi tiết user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Toggle user active/inactive
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/users/2/toggle-active
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============================================================
### 5. STUDENTS - Danh sách sinh viên
### ============================================================

### Lấy tất cả students
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/students?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Tìm kiếm student theo MSSV
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/students?search=23115053122326
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lọc student theo status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/students?status=Active&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============================================================
### 6. PRODUCTS - Danh sách sản phẩm
### ============================================================

### Lấy tất cả products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/products?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Tìm kiếm product
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/products?search=MacBook&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Xóa product
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/products/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============================================================
### 7. RENTALS - Danh sách đơn thuê
### ============================================================

### Lấy tất cả rentals
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/rentals?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lọc rental theo status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/rentals?status=Completed&page=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lọc rental Pending
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/rentals?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============================================================
### 8. SALE ORDERS - Danh sách đơn mua
### ============================================================

### Lấy tất cả sale orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/sale-orders?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lọc sale order theo status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/sale-orders?status=Completed
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lọc sale order Pending
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/sale-orders?status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============================================================
### 9. PAYMENTS - Danh sách thanh toán
### ============================================================

### Lấy tất cả payments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/payments?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lọc theo payment type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/payments?paymentType=RentalFee
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lọc theo payment status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/payments?paymentStatus=Completed
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lọc kết hợp
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/payments?paymentType=Commission&paymentStatus=Completed
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============================================================
### 10. TRANSACTIONS - Danh sách giao dịch
### ============================================================

### Lấy tất cả transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/transactions?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lọc theo type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/transactions?type=Commission
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lọc theo userId
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/transactions?userId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============================================================
### 11. COMMISSIONS - Danh sách hoa hồng
### ============================================================

### Lấy danh sách hoa hồng
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/commissions?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============================================================
### 12. CATEGORIES - Danh sách danh mục
### ============================================================

### Lấy tất cả categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============================================================
### 13. REVIEWS - Danh sách đánh giá
### ============================================================

### Lấy tất cả reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/reviews?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lọc theo productId
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/reviews?productId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Lọc theo rating
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Admin/reviews?rating=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============================================================
### NOTES:
### 1. Thay {{adminToken}} bằng JWT token thực sau khi login
### 2. Tất cả endpoints yêu cầu Role = "Admin"
### 3. Pagination: page bắt đầu từ 1, pageSize tối đa 100
### 4. Search hỗ trợ tìm kiếm không phân biệt hoa thường
### ============================================================
